===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# A widely occurring [[mineral]] ([[calcium fluoride]]), of various [[colour]]s, used as a [[flux]] in [[steelmaking]], and in the [[manufacture]] of [[glass]], [[enamel]]s and [[hydrofluoric acid]].
#: '''''Fluorite''' is the main natural resource of Thailand.''

